---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Pricing"
  description="The core design tools are free — no credit card, no signup — and they stay free. High-quality render credits are coming as an optional add-on; join the waitlist."
>
  <section class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow">Simple by design</span>
    <h1>Free to design. Render credits are optional.</h1>
    <p>Everything you need to design is free: draw your floor plan, furnish it, and walk through it in 3D. There is no credit card to enter and no signup — open the app and start drawing. That part stays free.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="number">FREE / CORE</span>
        <h3>Design tools — free</h3>
        <p>Draw floor plans, furnish rooms, and view your design in 3D. No account, no credit card, no cost. We plan to keep it that way, and if that ever changes for any part of the product, we'll say so here plainly before it happens.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="number">COMING / WAITLIST</span>
        <h3>Render credits — optional add-on, not yet available</h3>
        <p>High-quality renders will run on optional credit packs. Two packs are planned: <strong>$5 for 5 credits</strong> and <strong>$15 for 20 credits</strong>. These are not available yet — no payments are taken and nothing can be bought today, and the pack details may change before launch.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p>When render credits open, we'll email the waitlist once. Joining takes a quick Google sign-in. Until then, designing is free and needs no account.</p>

    <div class="pricing-ctas">
      <a class="button alt" rel="noopener" href="https://app.buildmy.house/?waitlist=1">Join the render credits waitlist</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://app.buildmy.house">Start designing — it's free ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .pricing-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
